1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,728
Chart ki har candle ek kahani

2
00:00:02,748 --> 00:00:03,613
batati hai.

3
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:05,177
Chalo padhna seekho,

4
00:00:05,197 --> 00:00:06,621
45 second mein.

5
00:00:06,641 --> 00:00:08,806
Ek candle mein 4 cheezein

6
00:00:08,826 --> 00:00:09,652
hoti hain:

7
00:00:09,672 --> 00:00:10,075
open,

8
00:00:10,095 --> 00:00:10,498
high,

9
00:00:10,518 --> 00:00:10,850
low,

10
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:11,916
aur close.

11
00:00:11,936 --> 00:00:13,590
Mota hissa body hai.

12
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:15,960
Yeh open se close tak jaata

13
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:16,529
hai.

14
00:00:16,549 --> 00:00:18,123
Upar aur neeche ki patli

15
00:00:18,143 --> 00:00:18,441
line,

16
00:00:18,461 --> 00:00:19,026
wick hai.

17
00:00:19,046 --> 00:00:20,619
Woh din ka high aur low

18
00:00:20,639 --> 00:00:21,583
dikhati hai.

19
00:00:21,603 --> 00:00:21,942
Close,

20
00:00:21,962 --> 00:00:23,020
open se upar hua,

21
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,046
toh candle green.

22
00:00:24,066 --> 00:00:25,651
Matlab khareedaar jeete.

23
00:00:25,671 --> 00:00:26,111
Close,

24
00:00:26,131 --> 00:00:27,621
open se neeche hua,

25
00:00:27,641 --> 00:00:28,803
toh candle red.

26
00:00:28,823 --> 00:00:30,928
Matlab bechne wale jeete.

27
00:00:30,948 --> 00:00:31,645
Example:

28
00:00:31,665 --> 00:00:33,478
share ₹100 pe khula,

29
00:00:33,498 --> 00:00:34,753
₹107 tak gaya,

30
00:00:34,773 --> 00:00:35,949
₹95 tak gira,

31
00:00:35,969 --> 00:00:38,161
aur ₹105 pe band hua.

32
00:00:38,181 --> 00:00:39,198
Toh green candle,

33
00:00:39,218 --> 00:00:40,234
upar chhoti wick,

34
00:00:40,254 --> 00:00:41,543
neeche lambi wick.

35
00:00:41,563 --> 00:00:42,897
Lambi wick bolti hai:

36
00:00:42,917 --> 00:00:43,980
price wahan gaya,

37
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,446
par tik nahi paaya.

38
00:00:45,466 --> 00:00:46,470
Par yaad rakho,

39
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:48,403
ek candle future nahi batati.

40
00:00:48,423 --> 00:00:50,223
Yeh bas batati hai ki kya

41
00:00:50,243 --> 00:00:50,727
hua.

42
00:00:50,747 --> 00:00:53,555
Follow karo The 7% Club.
